 907:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_service.cpp ****      * WebConfig deliberately initializes before the CH585 is exposed to the
 908:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_service.cpp ****      * browser. USBDriver::prepare() has already selected the profile, but
 909:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_service.cpp ****      * USBDriver::connect() must not run until this service has installed the
 910:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_service.cpp ****      * receive callback. Otherwise an eager browser can send the first
 911:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_service.cpp ****      * attestation report into a real, credited channel while the callback is
 912:Cpp_Core/Src/webhid_service.cpp ****      * still null, permanently losing that bootstrap generation.
